4. Comparison methods
================================================================================

The fifteen prior methods reproduced for the paper's main table were each trained
with their own upstream implementation, and every resulting checkpoint inherits
that implementation's terms. Four of them ship no upstream LICENSE file at all.
Per-method attribution, licence text and the exact wording each one requires are
in MODEL_ZOO.md and in the model cards accompanying the released weights.
